  "source_sha256": "fad9ca98896cf5ab8cc9ec03455092d549bba8f9f5b6d60710af3c18b627d5ed",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "65ed8c9dc870f4d9fe678288d02d6fc9547c200a35cfc64bc005237a24f76ddd",
      "text": "Jade Rabbit’s\nFirst Ballet Class",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "462dee73ef9eb17e6eaae9b916a83b8d68ad2831c32ed13db48762ded8be3886",
      "text": "Jade steps into class.\n“I want to dance!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7be89ad2a0d4aee63be0da5a77cf6eec53b084c36dfffe89d86b3be2a03fc5d5",
      "text": "Soft shoes.\nA green skirt.\n“My ears are ready, too!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6df677716f4561e8592b7228a5d5c30ec846fac6c1ca2f237ead823fc3d7724e",
      "text": "The teacher plays a tune.\n“Step with me.”\nStep, step, step.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "08d5c9ab97f335bb9d529ec41d420be9d2b268db510fd6457dd6a2beab24be25",
      "text": "Jade hops up high.\n“Oops! That was a hop.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "738bef40e0b576b7f9186f85aebe336d5f81a85569892f05a581dab5880dc891",
      "text": "“Try small steps,” says the\nteacher.\nJade steps with Chang’e.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "441133d44fa8bd4c60f87f5b1cd2e28a31faf4125eb0da0eebe8168c5c06a219",
      "text": "Slow feet.\nSoft feet.\nThey move to the beat.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e87e0a8841c95a435418a793fbfccea4d9046eaf8dda58c7598785415b5bb59b",
      "text": "The music stops.\nJade stops.\nHer ears keep dancing!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "eff5b3b2f067101ee2164908a82aaabf58dc2031c82f0b879386757dcd4b2115",
      "text": "“Turn slowly,” says the\nteacher.\nJade makes a small turn.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "239ed1d4746dfca3f4593b9cd128ca8c7d5c9ebdb175dee94e479aa257b03951",
      "text": "Chang’e turns the other way.\n“Oh! Hello, Jade!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3a5eb5020a9a7a4e08716200e28ea14903a6fd8f08f0c79ee83452eb2a1e083b",
      "text": "They giggle.\nThey try again.\n“Small steps. A slow turn.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "13e0dcf8af6f3caec80004f558ccdbbf72d02c831f326ec643c57a5b1538fb98",
      "text": "Now Jade listens to the beat.\nStep, step.\nTurn, turn.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ec8553afda40750532423f2f9fc7789eb9f33645b02935c1efcc7dd74baba1cc",
      "text": "“And stop!”\nTwo friends stop.\nTwo ears wobble.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3c5d78deb2df321ef7ecd94d0ad472573b49b234dabcd712af7cd4f521ac7b26",
      "text": "“Let’s dance it all!”\nSmall steps. A slow turn.\nAnd stop!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5f0d2b86961dd270666495cde57a2e31c4da8c60f1b44f720ba18ab1d005932d",
      "text": "“We did it!” says Jade.\nChang’e smiles and claps.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "371ef30eaf53bd13f6895fb225e251dc28837ca2368db1d663c1abb7bf5c831a",
      "text": "Jade takes a little bow.\nHer ears bow, too.\n“One more dance?”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b6f14abd05c0cd0e1ecc06a7a775d666ab6e243347598fcce36a91498c2c38c0",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed this story, you are welcome\nto support more. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStory and art made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
